  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN247.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaḷatu vēṟūpāṭu kaṇṭu vēṟupaṭṭa tōḻikkut talaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What SHE said to the confidante who had undergone changes when seeing the changes in HER who had undergone changes during the separation from HIM.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN247.1">
        <l>maṇṇā mutta moḻukiya vaṉamulai</l>
        <l>naṉmā ṇākam pulampa nattuṟantava</l>
        <l>raruḷilar vāḻi tōḻi poruḷpurin</l>
        <l>tiruṅkiḷai yeṇki ṉaḻalvā yēṟṟaik</l>
        <l>karuṅkōṭ ṭiruppai veṇpū muṇaiyiṟ</l>
        <l>peruñcem puṟṟi ṉiruntalai yiṭakku</l>
        <l>mariya kāṉa meṉṉār pakaipaṭa</l>
        <l>muṉaipāḻ paṭṭa vāṅka <supplied>ṇā</supplied>ṭpārttuk</l>
        <l>kolaival yāṉai curaṅkaṭi koḷḷu</l>
        <l><supplied>mū</supplied>ṟupaṭu kavalaiya vāṟupala nīntip</l>
        <l>paṭumuṭai nacaiiya paṟaineṭuṅ ka<supplied>ḻu</supplied>ttiṟ</l>
        <l>pā<supplied>ṟu</supplied>kiḷai cē<supplied>k</supplied>kuñ cēṭcimaik</l>
        <l>kōṭuyar piṟaṅkaṉ malaiyiṟan tōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>He who abandoned us so that [my] good glorious chest with beautiful</l>
        <l corresp="1f">breasts on which unpolished pearls are arranged is lonely,</l>
        <l corresp="3">is without consideration, oh friend, he who, desiring wealth,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">does not say that the forests are difficult,</l>
        <l corresp="4">where the fire-mouthed male of the bear with [his] big family</l>
        <l corresp="5">when he dislikes the white flower of the Mahua tree with black branches</l>
        <l corresp="6">digs up the large top of the big red ant hill,</l>
        <l corresp="10">he who, crossing many ways with blocked crossroads,</l>
        <l corresp="9">where elephants capable of killing stand guard in the desert,</l>
        <l corresp="7d-8">looking out for men in those places that fell into ruin on the frontier when it was attacked,</l>
        <l corresp="13">traversed the glittering mountains high with peaks,</l>
        <l corresp="12">with far-away summits, where the kin of the kite dwell,</l>
        <l corresp="11">with wings [and] long necks, who yearn for falling flesh.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

